[
${TYPE}=<<EOM
jailrun is installed to ${PREFIX}/bin/jailrun.

Before first use, verify host readiness:

    jailrun doctor

Required host configuration (checked by doctor):
  - ZFS pool with datasets for images, bases, and runs
  - linux64 kernel module loaded (for Linuxulator support)
  - kern.racct.enable=1 in /boot/loader.conf (for rctl resource limits)
  - skopeo(1) from sysutils/skopeo

Optional, recommended for full compatibility:
  - pkg install bash gsed coreutils gmake curl git gtar gnugrep \\
      diffutils patch findutils less ccache openssh-portable

See jailrun(1) for full documentation, or run:

    jailrun help
EOM
]
